B.a0L=new A.bQ(B.it,["How do I get assigned to a job?",'Jobs are assigned by the tenant administrator. Once assigned, you\'ll receive a push notification and the job will appear in your "My Jobs" section. Make sure your notifications are enabled for timely updates.'],t.C)
B.a0O=new A.bQ(B.it,["How are my ratings calculated?","Your rating is the average of all ratings given by tenants after each completed job. Ratings range from 1 to 5 stars. We recommend completing jobs promptly and professionally to maintain a high rating."],t.C)
